      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "sfx",
      "text": "the cat purring even louder, close up",
      "duration": 2.0,
      "timing": "before"
    },
    {
      "text": "[laughing] I have to purr?",
      "voice_id": "vnJXCu1mkdsxb9UdCYZp",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "[calm] Yes. Tip of the tongue behind your top teeth. Let it buzz.",
      "voice_id": "nJ8YqEenIxs18T0Hu4QE",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "[slowly] Ruoka.",
      "voice_id": "nJ8YqEenIxs18T0Hu4QE",
      "lang": "fi"
    },
    {
      "text": "Food.",
      "voice_id": "nJ8YqEenIxs18T0Hu4QE",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "[carefully] Ruoka.",
      "voice_id": "vnJXCu1mkdsxb9UdCYZp",
      "lang": "fi"
    },
    {
      "type": "sfx",
      "text": "a front door opening, slippers on the floor",
      "duration": 1.5,
      "timing": "before"
    },
    {
      "text": "[proudly] Ruisleipää!",
      "voice_id": "Gp43kq9FsSlavD7esRtx",
      "lang": "fi"
    },
    {
      "text": "[delighted] Rye bread! And listen to that r!",
      "voice_id": "vnJXCu1mkdsxb9UdCYZp",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "One more thing. P, t and k are soft here. No puff of air. Our city.",
      "voice_id": "nJ8YqEenIxs18T0Hu4QE",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "[slowly] Tampere.",
      "voice_id": "nJ8YqEenIxs18T0Hu4QE",
      "lang": "fi"
    },
    {
      "text": "[carefully] Tampere.",
      "voice_id": "vnJXCu1mkdsxb9UdCYZp",
      "lang": "fi"
